     "from": "none",
     "to": "prophylaxis",
     "why": "**SEQUENCE PUBLISHED IN JANUARY, AUTHORISED VACCINE IN DECEMBER — ELEVEN MONTHS, AGAINST A PRIOR RECORD MEASURED IN DECADES.** The mRNA design work took days once the genome was public; the rest was trials and manufacturing. **The decisive innovation was organisational rather than scientific**: running phases in parallel instead of in series, and manufacturing at risk before anybody knew whether the product worked. The science had been accumulating for thirty years in lipid nanoparticles, nucleoside modification and pre-fusion antigen stabilisation — the same structural trick that finally produced an RSV vaccine (`childhood-pneumonia`). Around 13 billion doses were administered. Modelling published in 2022 estimated something like **14 million deaths averted in the first year of rollout alone.** **And the distribution was the failure everybody could see happening.** High-income countries were administering boosters while low-income countries had not covered their health workers. COVAX under-delivered against its own targets by roughly half. That is `access`, at the largest scale the register contains, and it is documented rather than alleged.",
