    "> **Long COVID probably deserves its own record.** It has its own Mondo term (`MONDO:0100233`), its own contested definition, `intervention: none`, and a prevalence range spanning an order of magnitude. Holding it as `residue` here understates it and holding it separately would double-count it — which is",
