     "what": "Dexamethasone is generic, costs pennies, and reached the world within weeks of the RECOVERY result — which is what the register looks like when a blocker is genuinely absent. **Nirmatrelvir-ritonavir went the other way.** Priced for high-income markets, subject to a voluntary licensing arrangement that improved matters unevenly, and in practice largely absent from the countries where the unvaccinated high-risk patients it works best in actually live. Generic supply arrived late and demand had collapsed by then, which is its own kind of failure. **The vaccine distribution failure is the same blocker at larger scale and it is fully documented**: high-income boosters while low-income countries had not covered health workers, COVAX delivering roughly half its target, and manufacturing capacity concentrated in a handful of countries. The technology-transfer hub established afterwards to build mRNA capacity in Africa is the structural answer and it is small and slow. Rated `documented` on the delivery figures, which are public and not in dispute.",
