     "units": "deaths/year — **and this is a genuinely clean zero of the kind `acute-bronchitis` earns.** Gonorrhoea kills almost nobody directly; disseminated gonococcal infection and gonococcal endocarditis are rare. The harm is infertility, pelvic inflammatory disease, ectopic pregnancy, neonatal blindness and facilitated HIV transmission — none of which the mortality column can hold",
