    "note": "**Eighty-two million infections a year and no deaths is the register's starkest mismatch between magnitude and the field that measures it.** The burden is reproductive: tubal damage and infertility in women, which arrives years later and is attributed to infertility rather than to this. gaps.md disability; this one is neither — it is a **future child who does not exist**, and there is no field for that at all."
