    "witness": "**THIS ROW IS RECORDED IN ORDER TO SHOW THE AXIS FAILING.** Survival is the one measure in this register that means the same thing everywhere, and here it means nothing at all: 99.9% to 99.99%, a gain of one part in a thousand, on a disease with eighty-two million cases a year whose real cost is infertility, ectopic pregnancy and blindness in newborns. **`asthma` at +0.017 and `covid-19` at +0.006 were the previous worst cases of this compression. This is an order of magnitude beyond both**, and it is the clearest argument in the corpus that a survival-ranked view of medicine must be read beside `residue` or not at all."
