     "kind": "policy",
     "blocks": "screening the sites and the people that carry it",
     "what": "**MOST TRANSMISSION COMES FROM INFECTIONS NOBODY KNEW ABOUT.** Pharyngeal and rectal infection is largely asymptomatic and is not routinely tested for in many systems that test for this disease at all; a large share of cervical infection is silent too. So the reservoir is invisible, the resistance incubator is unexamined, and partner notification runs on the minority who had symptoms. Where extragenital screening of higher-incidence populations exists it finds a great deal, and where sexual health services have been cut, incidence has risen. **This is an ordinary delivery problem attached to an extraordinary resistance problem** — and it is the half that money moves, which is worth stating in a record whose other blockers are all `scale: null` or a billion dollars.",
