    "witness": "Susceptibility testing exists and is rarely performed, so regimens are chosen empirically and quietly fail against rising clarithromycin resistance. The measurement gap here is neither scientific nor technological but a matter of what gets ordered — the cheapest kind to close. Which colonised person will ulcerate remains unpredictable, though it matters less once the organism is simply eradicated."
