    "permanent": false,
    "what": "A fortnight of oral antibiotics. Nausea, taste disturbance and diarrhoea during the course, and Clostridioides difficile infection occasionally; nothing permanent is taken. This is the register's reference point for a clean cure, and the reason `toll` had to exist to distinguish it from the others.",
