     "why": "**Haemophilus influenzae type b conjugate vaccination**, which removed the commonest cause of childhood bacterial meningitis in every country that introduced it. Dated loosely across the introduction period. One of the most complete disease eliminations any vaccine has achieved, and it is almost never named as one.",
     "src": "recall"
