     "units": "fraction-of-patients (diagnosed, and treated appropriately when treatment is indicated) — **the shortfall is diagnostic and it is not a resource-poor-setting story.** This is underdiagnosed in one of the wealthiest health systems on earth, because clinicians outside the endemic area do not think of it and clinicians inside it often do not test. Fluconazole is generic and universally available",
