     "from": "none",
     "to": "suppressive",
     "why": "**Fluconazole converted coccidioidal meningitis from uniformly fatal to indefinitely controllable.** Before the triazoles, treatment was intrathecal amphotericin B — repeated injections into the cerebrospinal space, poorly tolerated and frequently unsuccessful. This is a survival transition the register would otherwise have missed entirely, because the record-level mortality is small.",
