     "why": "Occupational dust controls and, in California, court-ordered exclusion of susceptible prisoners from hyperendemic institutions. **Dated loosely; the litigation and the guidance developed over roughly two decades.** Recorded because it is the only prevention gain in the register delivered through a court rather than a health system.",
     "src": "reasoning"
