     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "The uterus does not contract, so the vessels that supplied the placenta do not close. **Almost all of the preventable deaths are here, and almost all of the cheap wins are too**: a uterotonic given prophylactically to every woman, uterine massage, tranexamic acid, and a balloon — which in the settings that pioneered it is a condom tied to a catheter and filled with saline."
