     "blocks": "a disease that belongs to nobody",
     "what": "Scabies arrived on the neglected tropical disease list in 2017, which is recent enough that it has none of the institutional apparatus the older entries have: no donation programme, no dedicated coalition of the kind trachoma has, no elimination target, and limited national programme capacity. It also does not fit the category cleanly, which is part of the problem. It is endemic in Pacific island communities and in London care homes, in refugee camps and in prisons, and the wealthy-country burden sits with institutional infection control rather than with any disease programme. A condition affecting three hundred million people is nobody's portfolio in particular.",
