     "what": "Wider excision, sentinel node biopsy, and — since the checkpoint era — adjuvant immunotherapy for resected node-positive disease, which reduces recurrence and brings the permanent endocrine toll to patients who are already cured. **Adjuvant therapy is where immunotherapy's harms fall on people who did not need it**, and there is no biomarker to aim it."
