     "toll": "major",
     "what": "**THE REVOLUTION DID NOT ARRIVE HERE.** Melanoma of the palms, soles, nail beds and mucosal surfaces is not caused by ultraviolet light, carries a far lower mutational burden, rarely has BRAF V600, and **responds to checkpoint blockade much less often** — the low mutational burden means few neoantigens, which is the same mechanism that makes cutaneous melanoma responsive, running backwards. It is diagnosed later, because nobody examines the sole of a foot, and it accounts for a much larger share of melanoma in people with darker skin. Same shape as small cell lung cancer: a stratum the era passed over, hidden inside a record whose headline is transformation."
