    "Whether the plateau represents cure is the record's central uncertainty and is stated as such rather than resolved.",
    "Acral and mucosal melanoma are treated here as one stratum and are probably two or more different diseases; the register has too little to separate them.",
    "Non-melanoma skin cancer — basal and squamous cell carcinoma — is vastly more common, rarely fatal, and absent from this register. It shares the exposure and almost nothing else."
