     "value": 1500000.0,
     "units": "estimated cases/year worldwide of invasive candidiasis, of which candidaemia is the diagnosable fraction — **and the ratio between the two is one of the least settled numbers in this record.** Blood culture detects perhaps half of invasive disease, so the counted cases and the true cases differ by a factor nobody has pinned down",
