     "what": "**The classical organism and the easy half.** *C. albicans* and *C. parapsilosis* remain largely fluconazole-susceptible; step-down to oral fluconazole after initial echinocandin therapy is routine, cheap and effective. The proportion has been falling for thirty years as azole use selected against it."
