     "what": "**Technically the same operation and an entirely different problem.** The surgery must happen within weeks, the eye is still growing so lens power selection is a moving target, and afterwards comes years of amblyopia therapy, patching, refractive correction and repeat procedures — the only part of this record with a heavy `ongoing` burden. Miss the window and the operation restores the optics and not the sight."
