     "toll": "major",
     "what": "Local treatment is the whole treatment and it works. SF3B1-mutant tumours are the caveat inside this stratum — an intermediate group whose metastases arrive late, sometimes past ten years, so \"cured\" here is a statement about a horizon. **This stratum is where the record's `curative` rating lives.**"
