    "note": "**Roughly half is HPV-attributable and the other half is not**, arising instead on a background of chronic inflammation — phimosis, lichen sclerosus, poor hygiene. So vaccination addresses half of this record and circumcision and hygiene address a different, overlapping part of it, which is unusual among the HPV cancers."
