     "what": "HPV vaccination was scoped to girls for roughly a decade in most countries that introduced it. **Roughly half of penile cancer is HPV-attributable, and men derive no herd protection from vaccinating girls against a cancer of their own tissue.** `head-neck-cancer` and `anal-cancer` record the same decision from their own sites; this is the third. Gender-neutral programmes correct it prospectively. The men presenting with this cancer for the next thirty years were adolescents during the girls-only decade.",
