    "witness": "**Anatomy sets this figure more than biology does.** The same virus in the same kind of epithelium yields 0.70 at the anus and vulva and 0.50 here, because there is nowhere to cut and the radiation field contains bladder and rectum. `anal-cancer` shows what chemoradiation achieves when the anatomy cooperates."
