    "witness": "**Among the very few records here where an organ genuinely repairs itself.** Fibrosis regresses when the insult stops, which is why the rung is `curative` and why this record's `residue` field cannot express what actually happens (gaps.md #176). The survival gap understates the point: for the hepatitis C fraction, curing the virus converts a progressive fatal disease into a recovering liver, and that transition happened inside a decade."
