     "what": "**Nine in ten, median survival over a decade, and mostly undiagnosed.** Remove the cause — cure the hepatitis, stop the alcohol, treat the metabolic disease — and fibrosis stabilises or regresses. Surveillance for varices and for liver cancer. **This is where the record can be won and where almost nothing is currently done**, because nobody is looking for these people."
