     "what": "**NO LICENSED VACCINE AND NO LICENSED THERAPEUTIC.** Clinically indistinguishable from Zaire disease, comparably lethal, and the products do not cross-protect — they target the Zaire glycoprotein. The 2022 Uganda outbreak was fought with isolation, contact tracing and supportive care, while candidate vaccines were rushed toward a trial that the outbreak ended before it could complete. **An outbreak that stops too soon to test the countermeasure is a specific and vicious failure mode**, and it is why Sudan virus still has nothing. This stratum is why the record spans the ladder."
