     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "Resected endoscopically, sometimes with a single instillation of chemotherapy afterwards, then watched. It recurs in a large share of patients and rarely progresses. **The burden here is not the disease and not the treatment — it is the surveillance.** A cystoscopy every few months for years, in an ageing patient, indefinitely."
