     "toll": "major",
     "what": "**THE STRATUM BCG EXISTS FOR.** High-grade disease and carcinoma in situ progress to muscle invasion often enough that the alternative is removing the bladder pre-emptively. Induction and maintenance BCG reduce recurrence and progression, and most of these patients keep their bladders as a result. **BCG-unresponsive disease is the frontier**: nadofaragene firadenovec, pembrolizumab and intravesical combinations exist and the standard answer is still cystectomy."
