     "what": "Platinum chemotherapy, then checkpoint blockade, and since 2023 **enfortumab vedotin with pembrolizumab as first line**, which produced the largest survival improvement this disease has seen and is the reason the `moved` block has a recent entry. Not curable. FGFR3-altered disease has erdafitinib as a further line."
