    "witness": "**The register's purest logistics record on this axis.** The treatment has existed since 1895, costs little to make, and 100,000 people a year die because it is not in the building they reach. Antivenom production has *contracted* in Africa as manufacturers withdrew — a survival figure moving backwards for commercial reasons."
