     "why": "**CD19 CAR-T CELLS**, approved for relapsed and refractory large B-cell lymphoma — patients who had exhausted chemotherapy and transplant, in whom roughly forty percent achieved durable remission. Bispecific antibodies followed, off the shelf and considerably cheaper than a manufactured cell product. The record-level move is five points, because the stratum it rescued is a minority of a minority. **For the people in it the move was from nothing to a real chance**, and gaps.md #61 is the reason those two sentences are both true.",
