     "to": "partial",
     "why": "**A diagnostic, not a discovery.** Commercial nucleic-acid tests for *M. genitalium* reached general availability around 2019, roughly thirty-eight years after the organism was identified — because it cannot practically be cultured. Its prevalence, its resistance profile and its clinical associations only became measurable at that point. **The organism had been causing urethritis throughout; the register could not have rated it.**",
