    "> `mechanism: partial` is doing unusual work: the *organism* is exceptionally well characterised — it is the minimal-genome model organism — and the *disease* is not. The axis conflates those, and this is the clearest record in the corpus where they come apart.",
    "> The claim that chlamydia treatment drove macrolide resistance is well-supported and is **an inference from timing, ecology and mechanism rather than a controlled demonstration**, which no design could have provided.",
