     "units": "new cases/year across the lip and oral cavity, oropharynx, larynx and hypopharynx — **a sum across subsites rather than a single published figure**, which is why the number is soft. Collectively the group is usually placed sixth or seventh among cancers worldwide. **Nasopharynx is excluded** and is a separate record",
