    "witness": "**A \"GOOD CHANCE\" RECORD WHOSE TOLL IS `catastrophic`, WHICH IS THE ARGUMENT FOR KEEPING THESE AXES APART.** Fifty-five percent survive five years; a large share of them do so without a larynx, without saliva, or with a feeding tube. **`survival` answers \"do I live\" and says nothing about \"as what\"** — `toll`, `residue` and `restored` carry that, and a dashboard showing survival alone would report this record as a success."
