     "units": "fraction-of-patients (reaching curative-intent treatment with the surgery, radiotherapy, reconstruction and rehabilitation it requires) — **this is not a drug, it is a service**, and the service is a head and neck surgeon, a radiotherapy machine, a reconstructive team, a speech and swallowing therapist and a dentist, in the same institution",
