     "what": "The tractable half. **Avibactam, vaborbactam and relebactam all inhibit these enzymes**, so ceftazidime-avibactam or meropenem-vaborbactam is an ordinary, well-tolerated beta-lactam that works. KPC predominates in the United States, Italy, Greece, Israel and much of Latin America; OXA-48-like in Turkey, North Africa and Europe."
