     "units": "people, roughly 7.6% of the world — **and this figure rose by something like seventy percent in a single GBD revision because the case definition was broadened to include hand and other joints, not because more knees wore out.** The earlier headline was around 344 million. Knee is the largest single site, then hand, then hip",
