     "units": "deaths/year attributed — **and unlike `hearing-loss`, where the zero is close to literal, this one is an accounting choice.** NSAID gastrointestinal bleeding kills, opioids prescribed for joint pain kill, and the cardiovascular consequences of years of enforced inactivity kill. Every one of those deaths is attributed to another cause",
