     "toll": "major",
     "what": "**The largest site and the one with the worst satisfaction figures.** Total knee arthroplasty relieves pain in the great majority and roughly one in five recipients remains dissatisfied, which is markedly worse than the hip and has never been adequately explained. Obesity's contribution is strongest here — the knee carries the load — and it is where weight loss does most."
