     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "**Total hip replacement has been called the operation of the century and the claim is not obviously wrong.** Pain relief is near-universal, function is restored, implants survive twenty-five years in the large majority, and the procedure is cheap by the standards of anything else that transforms a life this completely. **This stratum is the single best result in the register that nobody talks about**, and it is why the record rates `curative`."
