     "toll": "major",
     "what": "Vascular invasion, extrahepatic spread, or symptoms. Systemic therapy: checkpoint blockade with an anti-angiogenic, or a multikinase inhibitor. Median survival has roughly doubled since 2007 and is still measured in months to a year and a half. **No biomarker selects any of it**, which is what `predictive: none` means in practice for the largest stratum in this record."
