     "units": "fraction alive on stage- and molecularly-appropriate therapy. **The figure has moved more in the last decade than in the preceding four**, on targeted therapy for driver mutations and checkpoint inhibition, and it remains one of the worst among common cancers because most patients present late. See this record's `efficacy` note on gaps.md #95 — the numerator here is a choice, and five-year survival is the strictest of the available ones",
     "src": "recall"
