    "witness": "**The clearest case in the register of a large relative gain that is still a bad number.** Five-year survival has roughly doubled and three quarters of patients are still dead at five years. A dashboard reporting the *change* would call this a triumph; one reporting the *level* would call it a failure; both are true and the register should print both."
