      "retrieved": "2026-08-27",
      "quote": "In the overall population, median OS was 13.2 months (95% CI: 10.0, not estimable [NE]) in the daraxonrasib arm and 6.7 months (95% CI: 5.8, 8.0) in the SOC arm (Hazard ratio 0.40 [95% CI: 0.30, 0.53]; p-value <0.0001)."
