    "witness": "**THE SECOND FLAGSHIP, AND THE FASTEST.** The transition took about two years from 1996, and it is why the ladder has a `suppressive` rung at all: **HIV is no longer a death sentence and it is not over.** `survival` reports the first half and cannot see the second."
