     "units": "people aged 15-49 living with HSV-2 worldwide — **one of the largest prevalence figures in this register**, and rising in absolute terms with population. Genital HSV-1 is additional and growing in high-income countries, where falling childhood HSV-1 acquisition leaves adolescents seronegative and susceptible to genital acquisition",
