     "value": 100000.0,
     "units": "new cases/year worldwide — a rough figure. THE PREVALENT POPULATION IS THE INTERESTING ONE AND IT IS RISING FAST, because patients on tyrosine kinase inhibitors are not dying: incidence is flat and the number of people living with CML climbs every year",
     "src": "reasoning"
