     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "A daily tablet, a blood test every three months, and a normal life. **This is what a solved chronic cancer looks like**, and it is ninety percent of the record. Roughly half of those achieving a sustained deep molecular response can attempt treatment-free remission, and roughly half of those succeed — see the `intervention` witness and gaps.md #118."
