     "units": "people with a detectable anogenital HPV infection at any given moment — roughly a tenth of adults, and a very poor guide to anything, because most of those infections will be gone within two years. **Lifetime acquisition is closer to eighty percent of sexually active people**, which makes this the commonest sexually transmitted infection in existence and one of the commonest infections of any kind",
