     "units": "deaths/year — **and this zero is the fourth instance of a pattern that is becoming the register's most common kind.** HPV kills through cervical, oropharyngeal, anal, vulvar, vaginal and penile cancer, and every one of those deaths is counted in a cancer record — two of which exist here and four of which do not. **The infection itself kills nobody**, and reporting a figure would double-count `cervical-cancer` and `head-neck-cancer`",
