    "note": "**The burden of this record is what the cancer records cannot see.** Genital warts affect tens of millions of people, cause substantial distress, recur after treatment and kill nobody. Recurrent respiratory papillomatosis is rare, acquired at birth from maternal infection, and requires repeated surgical debulking of the airway through childhood. Neither appears in a record about cancer, and neither would be prevented by anything except the vaccine that already exists."
