     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "**The \"honeymoon\", and it is one of the most satisfying periods in neurology.** Levodopa restores function almost completely: people return to work, to driving, to their lives. It lasts perhaps three to seven years, it costs pennies a day, and it does nothing at all to the disease."
