     "what": "Wearing-off, dyskinesia, and a medication schedule built around them. This is where **deep brain stimulation, focused ultrasound lesioning, apomorphine and intestinal levodopa gel** earn their place — all of them managing the consequences of the treatment as much as the disease. It is also where the `toll` above concentrates."
