     "what": "**The features that dominate here do not respond to dopamine at all**, which is the plainest statement of what levodopa never fixed: postural instability and falls, freezing of gait, dysautonomia, and **dementia, which affects the majority of people who live long enough.** Aspiration pneumonia is what usually appears on the certificate. Treatment is supportive, and this stratum is where `huntington`'s efficacy of zero becomes the honest comparison."
