     "what": "**The two billion, and the rung is `none` in the strongest sense the register has.** Not \"nothing works well\" — nothing acts on this stage at all. Every licensed agent targets the replicating tachyzoite; the cyst is metabolically quiescent, walled, and invisible to the immune system that is nonetheless the only thing containing it. Most of these people will never have a symptom, and none of them can be cleared."
