     "what": "Fever and cervical lymphadenopathy in an immunocompetent person, resolving over weeks without treatment. **Rated `none` because nothing medicine does changes it** — the same uncomfortable rating `acute-bronchitis` earns for the same reason, and the same missing rung (gaps.md #225)."
