     "why": "**A record moving BACKWARDS, and the register should have more of these.** The United States price of pyrimethamine was raised roughly fifty-fold by an acquiring company, on a sixty-year-old off-patent drug. `moved:` exists to make a second pass a comparison rather than a fresh opinion, and a comparison that only ever improves is not measuring anything.",
     "src": "recall"
