    "note": "**The burden of this record is not in any of these fields.** It is roughly three hundred million episodes, a large fraction of them medicated with an antibiotic that cannot work, and the downstream resistance that follows — none of which the schema has a place for. `deaths: 0`, `ylds` negligible, and it is plausibly among the most consequential entries here."
