     "units": "people diagnosed with cystic fibrosis worldwide — **and the true number is higher.** CF was long considered a disease of European-ancestry populations, and it is substantially under-diagnosed in South Asia, the Middle East and Latin America, where the mutation spectrum differs and newborn screening mostly does not exist",
