    "witness": "**THE RECORD THAT SHOWS THIS AXIS MEASURING THE WRONG THING.** Measles is `preventable` — a two-dose vaccine at 97% effectiveness, in use since 1963 — and the entire achievement is that people do not get it. The survival columns are nearly identical and nearly irrelevant; the 110,000 annual deaths are a vaccination-coverage figure wearing a mortality costume."
