     "toll": "major",
     "what": "**The stratum patients transition INTO**, which is why the strata here are not a partition of people but stages of one course (gaps.md #111). Steady accrual of disability with or without superimposed relapses. Anti-inflammatory therapy does much less here, and until recently nothing worked at all. **A Bruton's tyrosine kinase inhibitor reported the first positive trial in non-relapsing secondary progressive disease in 2024-25**, slowing confirmed disability progression by around a third — which is real, new, and of the same order as anti-amyloid therapy in `alzheimers`."
