     "toll": "major",
     "what": "Progressive from onset, with no relapses. Older at onset, and the sex ratio is close to even rather than female-predominant. **Ocrelizumab in 2017 produced the first positive trial in this stratum** — roughly a quarter reduction in confirmed disability progression — after decades in which every agent failed. **That number deserves a comparison this register can make and few readers will**: it is almost exactly the effect size of lecanemab in early Alzheimer's, which the `alzheimers` record describes as below the threshold anybody perceives. Same rung, same magnitude, and in one record it is celebrated and in the other it is contested."
