     "what": "A monthly injection for ten-plus years requires a register, a reminder system, a reachable clinic, and someone to give it. Programmes that have done this well (parts of the Pacific, some Australian jurisdictions) show it works; most places have no register at all.",
     "who_could": [
      "health-system",
      "nonprofit",
      "software"
     ],
     "scale": 100000000.0,
     "standing": "documented",
