     "date": 2015,
     "axis": "intervention",
     "from": "symptomatic",
     "to": "disease-modifying",
     "why": "A randomised trial established that **six months of valganciclovir improved hearing and neurodevelopmental outcomes over six weeks** in symptomatic congenital infection — the first demonstration that treating a congenitally infected newborn changes the outcome rather than only the virology. Modest, real, and the only thing on this axis to have moved.",
     "src": "recall"
