     "why": "**Letermovir**, licensed for CMV prophylaxis after allogeneic stem-cell transplantation: a new target, effective, and without the marrow toxicity that limits every other agent in this record. **It moved the transplant stratum and did nothing for the newborns**, which is why the record-level figure moves by less than the result deserves.",
