     "units": "fraction-of-treated getting meaningful and durable symptomatic benefit — a reasoned estimate, and it is generous. Midodrine, droxidopa and fludrocortisone genuinely help orthostatic hypotension. Levodopa helps a minority partially and transiently, and the poverty of that response is a diagnostic criterion. **Nothing touches the progression at all**, and the number describes comfort rather than course",
