     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "**THE MODAL PATIENT, AND THE DRUGS DO WHAT THEY SAY.** Decline of forced vital capacity roughly halved, oxygen and pulmonary rehabilitation as the disease progresses, and a median survival measured in years rather than months. **This is what `disease-modifying` looks like when the rung is earned rather than stretched** — real, replicated, licensed, and not remotely a cure."
