     "toll": "minor",
     "what": "**A SUBSTANTIAL MINORITY DECLINE PRECIPITOUSLY AND NOBODY CAN IDENTIFY THEM AT DIAGNOSIS.** Some progress over months rather than years; others are punctuated by acute exacerbations that carry roughly fifty percent in-hospital mortality and have no effective treatment. **`prognostic: partial` is carrying this row** — the register can say what IPF does on average and not what it will do to a person, which is the question being asked."
