     "what": "Active viral replication with liver inflammation or fibrosis. A daily generic tablet suppresses the virus in almost everybody and substantially reduces progression. **This is the stratum where a thirty-dollar-a-year drug is failing to reach roughly nine in ten of the people it would help**, and the reason is the assessment required to establish that they belong in it."
