    "note": "**THE BURDEN IS SMALL AND THE ATTENTION IS NOT, AND BOTH FACTS ARE DEFENSIBLE.** A hundred and fifty thousand cases against lung cancer's two million. But it kills young and middle-aged adults, it takes cognition and personality before it takes life, and it has been a target of enormous research investment for four decades — which makes it one of the register's best tests of whether effort tracks anything at all."
