    "witness": "**TERMINAL, AND UNIQUELY AMONG THE TERMINAL RECORDS IT DID NOT HAVE TO BE.** The other four in this band are terminal because nobody knows how to treat them. **This one is terminal because somebody sold asbestos**, and the difference matters for what the register is for: `rabies` and `prion-disease` are waiting on science, and this is waiting on a decision that seventy countries have already taken. **The gap between the columns is real and small.** Six to nine months untreated, around eighteen treated — pemetrexed in 2003, immunotherapy in 2020, each adding months. **Two decades of therapeutic progress against a twenty-to-fifty-year latency**: everybody who will die of this before 2060 was already exposed before the first of those drugs existed."
