     "what": "**Nearly half of diagnosed patients, and nothing modifies the disease.** Memantine and cholinesterase inhibitors for symptoms; management of agitation, sleep and incontinence; and eventually feeding difficulty, immobility and the pneumonia that will be on the certificate. **This is where the trillion dollars and the unpaid care are**, and it is why the record flags ⧉ — the treatable strata and the expensive stratum are not the same people."
