    "note": "Estimates span roughly 0.1% to 0.8% of the population depending entirely on which case definition is applied — an eightfold range that is a property of the definitions, not of measurement error. Post-COVID cohorts have raised both attention and counts. Any burden-weighted use of this file must carry the range, not the midpoint."
