     "what": "**THE STRATUM THAT MEDICINE AND AGRICULTURE CREATED, AND THEN CLOSED.** Iatrogenic CJD from cadaveric growth hormone, dura mater grafts, corneal transplants and contaminated neurosurgical instruments — several hundred cases, essentially all now historical because the practices stopped. **Variant CJD** from bovine spongiform encephalopathy, roughly 230 deaths, ended by a feed ban. **Kuru**, transmitted by mortuary practice in Papua New Guinea, ended when the practice did. **Every acquired route was closed by a decision, and none of them was closed by a treatment.**"
